This is a UDP server for Mach 3.0.  Some parts of the code are grabbed
from the regular mach sources.  Check the source files to see which
copyright holds for each.  The server is described in the following
paper.

	Maeda, Chris and Brian N. Bershad. "Networking Performance for
	Microkernels".  In Proceedings of the Third Workshop on
	Workstation Operating Systems (WWOS-3).  April 1992.  IEEE Press.

You can also anonymously ftp the paper from mach.cs.cmu.edu in
/doc/mach3/netperf.ps.

Chris Maeda (cmaeda@cs.cmu.edu)
School of Computer Science
Carnegie Mellon University
5000 Forbes Ave
Pittsburgh PA  15213-3890
USA
